mode: "100644"
text: "# Growth plays, the funnel + two worked examples\n\n## The reply flywheel (the #1 lever — human / community-management)\n```\n1. Pick 5-15 accounts/conversations in your niche (similar size + a few bigger).\n2. Reply with genuine value FAST (be early; the first replies on a rising post get seen most).\n3. Reply to every comment on YOUR posts in the first hour (your replies count toward the post).\n4. Leap into trending niche conversations same-day. Positive/constructive only.\n-> Run by a human (or community-management). WoopSocial publishes your original posts; it doesn't reply.\n```\n\n## Niche/angle worksheet\n```\nOne sharp value promise: \"we make X simpler\" / \"we clarify Y\" / \"we find Z first\".\n1-2 topic areas only -> the interest-graph classifies you + the audience knows what they're following.\n```\n\n## Cadence + timing\n```\n3-5 posts/week (NOT >3/day). Post when YOUR audience is awake (strong windows e.g. Wed 7am, Thu/Fri am - verify).\nStay for the first hour to reply. 60-90 day horizon before momentum compounds.\n```\n\n## Format mix + tags\n```\nPhotos +60% > text-only; video w/ captions best; links +17% (under media). ONE topic tag (not hashtags).\nKeyword in natural language in the first two lines. Original + positive. (The actual post -> threads-post.)\n```\n\n## Threads -> Instagram funnel\n```\nThreads = discovery (topical reach) -> Instagram = conversion (Reels/carousels, commerce).\nRoute the most interested users to an IG asset; repurpose a top Thread within 24-72h while momentum lasts.\nBenchmarks (verify): Threads->IG profile-visit conv ~6-12%; reply rate >~2%/post.\n```\n\n## Metrics dashboard (native analytics)\n```\nReach/post | REPLIES/post (track replies / reach -- the heaviest signal) | follower-growth rate | profile visits\nHigh reach + flat follower growth -> hook/value problem. Replies < ~2% -> reassess messaging.\n```\n\n## Worked example 1 - solo founder, B2B niche (blunt indie-founder voice)\n```\nNICHE: \"make bookkeeping less painful\". 4 posts/week, Wed 7am. REPLY ENGINE (me, daily): reply into 10 finance\nconversations + every comment on my posts in the first hour. FORMAT: one chart photo + one topic tag. WoopSocial\npublishes the originals on schedule; I run the replies. Threads -> route to my IG Reels. Track replies/reach weekly. No bait, no dunks.\n```\n\n## Worked example 2 - small brand, starting cold, no IG (warm studio voice)\n```\nNICHE: one promise, one topic. Interest-graph means I don't need a following to start. 3-5 posts/week, positive tone,\nphotos + one tag. The growth is the replying -- leaping into relevant conversations early (human). 60-90 day horizon.\nWoopSocial publishes my posts; Communities/DMs I handle natively. Watch reach + follower growth, adjust the hook.\n```\n\nBoth: conversation-first, reply-more-than-post; one niche; first-hour velocity; original + positive; 3-5/week\ncompounding; WoopSocial publishes the posts while the reply engine is human; metrics native (never fabricated).\n"
